[-] translucence		<-->	n++[--0]	./trænzˈluːsns/-NAmE /trænzˈluːsns/ (also translucency  /trænzˈluːsnsi/  /trænzˈluːsnsi/) [uncountable] (formal)  [orw.255]
	;sự/tính trong suốt -- (1) the ability to allow light to pass through without being completely clear
